# Committed deliberately: these two values are the Supabase anon/publishable
# key and project URL, which are designed to be public (exposed to the
# browser) — not secrets. This lets the Vercel Git-integration build pick
# them up automatically, since this session has no way to set dashboard
# project env vars via API. NEVER add SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY, or CRON_SECRET here or to any committed file — those
# are real secrets and must only ever live in Vercel's dashboard env vars.
